WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Your own progressions
Record your chords, fix one, set the length, name it, and play it from anywhere.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.340
1. Record a progression
On the Home page, press PLAY, then REC. Polly clicks until the next bar, then starts recording.

3
00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:18.130
1. Record a progression
Play Am, F, C and G, one chord per bar.

4
00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:24.300
1. Record a progression
Press REC again. Your chords go into P9, the first empty progression, and the band loops them.

5
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:30.780
2. Fix a chord
Press ARP for the Progression page. Turn KNOB 1 (Bar) to bar 4.

6
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:39.580
2. Fix a chord
Turn KNOB 3 (Root) to E and KNOB 4 (Type) to 7. G becomes E7.

7
00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:48.760
3. Change the length
Turn SELECT to page 2, then KNOB 1 (Length) to 2. The band plays Am and F.

8
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:54.560
3. Change the length
Turn KNOB 1 back to 4. The hidden chords come back.

9
00:00:54.560 --> 00:01:00.140
4. Name it
Turn KNOB 4 (Name) to Verse.

10
00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:10.606
5. Switch progressions
Hold HOME and press white key 1. From the next bar, the band plays the ready-made P1.

11
00:01:10.606 --> 00:01:20.706
5. Switch progressions
Hold HOME and press white key 9. Your Verse comes back at the next bar.

12
00:01:20.706 --> 00:01:24.586
5. Switch progressions
Press PLAY to stop.

13
00:01:24.586 --> 00:01:28.600
Next: 103
Your song.
